9. Graph intelligence

This is one of the strongest parts of the system.

Imagine:
                  ┌── Vehicle A
                  │
Suspect A ────────┤
   │              │
   │              └── Case 102
   │
   ├── Phone X
   │
   └── Location Y
          │
          └── Case 87
                 │
                 └── Suspect B

The agent can answer:

"What connections exist between Suspect A and Case 87?"

The graph engine finds paths.

The LLM then explains the graph, rather than inventing the relationship.


